              behavior: T("La etapa fallida es la última sin éxito anotada por timed/timedValue (o la siguiente no ejecutada). Si la causa es un fallo definitivo de la herramienta nativa se emite GRAMMAR_NATIVE_VERIFICATION_FAILED con causa y solución; en otro caso, y solo si no hay ya un ERROR, se emite un diagnóstico GRAMMAR_COMPILATION_<ETAPA>. Una cancelación se anota como etapa CANCELLED sin diagnóstico.", "The failed stage is the last unsuccessful one recorded by timed/timedValue (or the next one not run). If the cause is a definitive native-tool failure, GRAMMAR_NATIVE_VERIFICATION_FAILED is emitted with cause and solution; otherwise, and only if there is no ERROR yet, a GRAMMAR_COMPILATION_<STAGE> diagnostic is emitted. A cancellation is recorded as a CANCELLED stage without a diagnostic."),
